--[[
	GOAT Hub — LuaProt Loader

	Why the old notice never showed:
	  sdk:loadScript() runs your full script and never returns, so any
	  code AFTER loadScript() never runs.

	Correct flow (LuaProt docs):
	  1) Set LP_CUSTOM_LOADER before loading (dashboard style must be "custom")
	  2) Optionally sdk:checkKey() for welcome data before loadScript
	  3) Then sdk:loadScript()

	Docs:
	  https://docs.luaprot.net/luaprot/macro-documentation/custom-loading-ui
	  https://docs.luaprot.net/luaprot/macro-documentation/key-check-library
	  https://docs.luaprot.net/luaprot/macro-documentation/v3-runtime-variables
]]

